---
import Countdown from './Countdown.astro';
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="glow hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <svg class="topo topo-drift" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <defs>
      <pattern id="topo" width="120" height="120" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
        <path d="M0 60 Q30 30 60 60 Q90 90 120 60" stroke="white" fill="none" stroke-width="0.5"/>
        <path d="M0 30 Q30 0 60 30 Q90 60 120 30" stroke="white" fill="none" stroke-width="0.5"/>
        <path d="M0 90 Q30 60 60 90 Q90 120 120 90" stroke="white" fill="none" stroke-width="0.5"/>
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#topo)"/>
  </svg>

  <div class="wrap inner">
    <h1>Be EUDR-ready <em>before</em> the deadline, not during it.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      From 30 December 2026, every shipment of cocoa placed on the EU market
      needs a Due Diligence Statement in TRACES, traced to the plot of land it
      grew on. Grovetrace is built for cocoa first, and for the six other EUDR
      commodities that work the same way.
    </p>
    <div class="ctas">
      <a class="cta" href="/demo/">Book a demo</a>
      <a class="ghost" href="#how-it-works">See how it works</a>
    </div>
    <div><Countdown /></div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: var(--hero-gradient);
          color: #E8ECE9; padding: 72px 0 140px; }
  /* Oversized and offset so the one-tile drift in motion.css never exposes
     an edge; the hero clips the overflow. */
  .topo { position: absolute; top: -140px; left: -140px;
          width: calc(100% + 280px); height: calc(100% + 280px); opacity: 0.06; }
  .glow { position: absolute; top: -30%; left: 8%; width: 70%; height: 150%;
          background: radial-gradient(closest-side,
                      rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.22), rgba(52, 211, 153, 0) 70%);
          opacity: 0.4; pointer-events: none; }
  .inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5.5vw, 3.4rem); max-width: 21ch; color: #fff; }
  h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--emerald); }
  .lede { margin: 22px 0 30px; font-size: 1.13rem; color: rgba(232,236,233,0.75);
          max-width: 58ch; }
  .ctas { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .cta { background: var(--emerald); color: #0B1D1C; text-decoration: none;
         padding: 13px 26px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; }
  .ghost { color: #E8ECE9; text-decoration: none; padding: 13px 20px;
           border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22); border-radius: 8px; }
</style>
